{
  "_comment": [
    "HAND-AUTHORED and NOT generated. --spark-synchronize-model leaves it alone because there is no",
    "CLR entity behind it: MyAccountRow is a virtual type, and preview.67 made a composed query on a",
    "clrType-less type first-class. Its rows are an aggregate over Account and Repository documents,",
    "built per request by Custom.MyAccounts (MyAccountRowActions -> IMyAccountsService).",
    "",
    "No clrType also means the framework defaults each row's link to null, so the first column is",
    "text rather than a dead link to a document that does not exist. Per-account navigation is the",
    "account-link renderer on Login instead: spark-po-detail does not forward the grid's rowRoute",
    "input, so on the auto-rendered Home card that escape hatch is unreachable.",
    "",
    "Only Query is granted on this type (security.json), never Read -- the pair that publishes a",
    "list whose rows have no detail page."
  ],
